1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
부모님 전화 끊고, 한참 앉아 있었나요?
Did you sit for a long time after a call with your parents?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,589
애니 딜러드는 말했어요.
Annie Dillard wrote,

3
00:00:06,689 --> 00:00:11,689
하루를 보내는 방식이 곧 삶이라고.
"How we spend our days is, of course, how we spend our lives."

4
00:00:11,789 --> 00:00:17,595
'밥은 먹었니' 한마디에 목이 메던 밤.
"Did you eat?" That one line tightens your throat, so you hang up quickly.

5
00:00:17,695 --> 00:00:23,500
그 짧은 안부도 숙제가 아니라 삶이에요.
That short check-in is life, too. Not homework.

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
오래 앉아 있었다면 이미 곁에 있었어요.
If you sat there afterward,
you were already beside them.
